      "published": "Mon, 27 Jul 2026 07:18:17 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<div><img alt=\"AI-generated experts Grace Carter, James Allen and Dan Brown have been widely quoted in mainstream news media.\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://pressgazette.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/07/ai_peeps-525x394.jpg\" style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\" width=\"525\" /></div>\n<p>Three more widely-published experts touted by PR industry appear not to exist</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://pressgazette.co.uk/news/journalist-response-platform-plays-whack-a-mole-against-ai-deluge-of-pr-content/\">Journalist response platform plays &#8216;whack-a-mole&#8217; against AI deluge of PR content</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://pressgazette.co.uk\">Press Gazette</a>.</p>",
      "source": "Press Gazette"
    },
