      "summary_raw": "<div><img alt=\"AI chatbots ChatGPT, Gemini, Microsoft Copilot, Claude, and Perplexity app icons are seen on the screen of an iPhone\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-post-image\" height=\"394\" src=\"https://pressgazette.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/sites/7/2026/01/shutterstock_25488645411-e1769777639587-525x394.webp\" style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\" width=\"525\" /></div>\n<p>Survey reveals crucial part publishers play in providing plausible AI responses.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://pressgazette.co.uk/comment-analysis/new-research-reveals-ai-answers-only-as-trusted-as-the-newsbrands-they-cite/\">New research reveals AI answers only as trusted as the newsbrands they cite</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://pressgazette.co.uk\">Press Gazette</a>.</p>",
